                       * init "dlaw_HI_exp.ini"                                                          *
                       * table SED "QSO.sed"                                                             *
                       * no line transfer                                                                *
                       * nuL(nu) = 44.0 at 1 Ryd                                                         *
                       * stop temperature off                                                            *
                       * metals 0.1                                                                      *
